-instance data read from a dedicated SSBO. This enables GPU-driven uniform updates via compute shaders instead of per-frame RenderingServer::instance_geometry_set_shader_parameter() calls.\r\n\r\nEngine modifications:\r\n- scene_forward_clustered_inc.glsl: Add custom_instance_uniforms SSBO (set=0, binding=21)\r\n- scene_forward_clustered_inc.glsl: Add custom_uniforms_ofs to InstanceData struct\r\n- shader_language.h: Add SCOPE_CUSTOM_INSTANCE to UniformScope enum\r\n- shader_compiler.h: Add custom_global_buffer_array_variable and custom_instance_uniform_index_variable\r\n- shader_compiler.cpp: Add SCOPE_CUSTOM_INSTANCE code generation branches\r\n- shader_language.cpp: Add 'custom uniform' keyword parsing\r\n- scene_shader_forward_clustered.cpp: Wire up custom uniform actions in init()\r\n- render_forward_clustered.cpp: Populate custom_uniforms_ofs in _fill_instance_data()\r\n- rendering_method.h: Add pre_render_compute() virtual hook\r\n- renderer_scene_cull.cpp: Call pre_render_compute() in update()\r\n- renderer_scene_cull.h: Add custom_shader_uniforms_offset field and setter\r\n- renderer_scene_cull.cpp: Implement instance_geometry_set_custom_shader_uniforms_offset()\r\n- rendering_server.h: Add virtual method declaration\r\n- rendering_server.cpp: Bind new method to GDExtension API\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request gui